{
  "_comment": "适配 Twitter/X API v2 风格（Recent search + users/:id/tweets）。需要一个有 v2 读权限的 bearer token（放环境变量 X_BEARER）。这只是字段映射示例，具体可用字段以你购买的套餐为准。",
  "name": "x-api-v2-style",
  "mode": "http",
  "timeout": 30,
  "headers": {
    "Authorization": "Bearer $X_BEARER"
  },
  "actions": {
    "search_posts": {
      "url": "https://api.twitter.com/2/tweets/search/recent?max_results=20&tweet.fields=created_at,public_metrics&expansions=author_id&user.fields=username,name",
      "method": "GET",
      "params": {"query": "{value}"}
    },
    "user_posts": {
      "_note": "官方 v2 取某人推文是两跳（先 /users/by/username 拿 id 再 /users/:id/tweets），本 provider 每次调用只发一跳。这里给的是第一跳；日常追人物推文建议改用单跳网关，或直接用宿主网页直读主页。",
      "url": "https://api.twitter.com/2/users/by/username/{value}?user.fields=id",
      "method": "GET"
    },
    "post_detail": {
      "url": "https://api.twitter.com/2/tweets?ids={value}&tweet.fields=created_at,public_metrics&expansions=author_id&user.fields=username,name",
      "method": "GET"
    }
  },
  "maps": {
    "items_path": "data",
    "id": "id",
    "url": "",
    "text": "text",
    "created_at": "created_at",
    "author_path": "",
    "author_handle_path": "username",
    "author_name_path": "name",
    "stats": "public_metrics"
  }
}
